openjev-skills keeps the skill wire-compatible with the TypeSafe System One
v1 API. The default base URL (https://api.typesafe.ai/v1) targets the hosted
TypeSafe API and is overridable via OPENJEV_BASE_URL to a self-hosted
openjev deployment. "TypeSafe", "System One", and related marks belong to
their respective owners; this project is an independent, community rebrand and is
